 TENHA UM ÓTIMO DIA E BOAS COMPRAS!', 19.34, 19.34, NULL, 'Spare Parts and Accessories for Vehicles > Spare Parts for Automobiles > Additive and Lubricant', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134201-825ad-mq4r16bgwoht49', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F1704733855%2F58257970756', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
