ombines the advantages of organic and inorganic cars to block UV rays without burden. - Customers who want a tone-up sunscreen with a moist and soft feel - Customers who want UV protection and skin tone correction at the same time - Naturally angry [How to use] At the last step of skin care, take an appropriate amount and spread evenly on areas exposed to UV rays. [Product capacity] 50ml #Korean cosmetics #K-beauty #good product #good price #skinfood ——————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ———————————————————————————————————————————————————— 🩶Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√ -------------------------------------------------- -------------------------------------------------- --------------', 71.88, 64.0, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Face Sunscreen', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-7rccr-lqwwxrkqcinc3c', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F25160742185', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
