kin Retinol & Retinal - Skin texture and trouble trace care - Vegan retinol containing plant-derived, hypoallergenic bakuchiol, comfortable for use by both sensitive skin and those new to retinol. - 10 types of hyaluronic acid adhere closely to the skin and fill the skin with moisture. - Irritation level 0.00 Completed hypoallergenic test for sensitive skin - Free from 20 ingredients that worry about skin - Dual functionality of whitening and wrinkle improvement - French EVE VEGAN certification [How to use] Step 1 1-2 times a week, after washing your face, adjust your skin texture with toner and attach the mask pack to your face. Step 2 After about 10 to 20 minutes, remove the mask and lightly tap the remaining essence on the skin to absorb it. [Product capacity] 22g [Options] reactivating mask 1ea reactivating mask 2ea reactivating mask 3ea #Korean cosmetics #K-beauty #good product #good price #the ordinary ——————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ——————————— 🩶Three Promises of koksara.kbeauty 1.We conduct disinfection three times a week.√ 2.We sell 100% genuine.√ 3.Chatable time: All the time [24/7].√ ——————————————————————————————————————————————————————— ———————————', 36.5, 23.85, NULL, 'Beauty > Skincare > Face Mask & Packs', 'https://cf.shopee.com.br/file/sg-11134207-7rcd9-lrshj7qxyanc13', 'https://shope.ee/an_redir?origin_link=https%3A%2F%2Fshopee.com.br%2Fproduct%2F457864097%2F24613684951', NULL, NULL, '2026-07-28T02:11:31.708458+00:00');
